 * gradient as its background (sized by --prime-divider-shimmer-width). The
 * layer itself is then translated from -100% to +100% of its own width, so
 * the highlight enters from off-left and exits off-right regardless of how
 * wide the rule or the highlight is. Percentages resolve against the
